      "id": "sol.amc-10a-fall-2021-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(2112-2021=91=7\\cdot13,\\) \\[ \\begin{aligned} \\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169} &=\\frac{(7\\cdot13)^2}{13^2}\\\\ &=7^2=49. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
